# Optional for local `npm run dev` only (Wrangler / @cloudflare/vite-plugin).
#
# This app skips Cloudflare Access JWT checks in development, so you do NOT
# need POLICY_AUD or TEAM_DOMAIN here for local work.
#
# If you want to test Access locally against a remote/preview Worker instead,
# uncomment and fill these in:
# POLICY_AUD=your-access-policy-audience-tag
# TEAM_DOMAIN=https://your-team.cloudflareaccess.com
